{"2542350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Masks of the Void: Origins", "steam_appid": 2542350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/2c63256ef4ce9577c073d050a5e7ffa9.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/67765f02505da5acc20fe8994f88646f.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/67765f02505da5acc20fe8994f88646f.webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/67765f02505da5acc20fe8994f88646f.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your way with endless combinations of <strong>Void Gifts, Cards, Shards, Documents &amp; Masks</strong>! Every run becomes a new experience as you progress through the Void.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Gifts</strong>: Game changing effects that can make your build focus on different gameplay bits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shards:</strong> Pure chaos, as random behaviours can occur, from helping to cursing you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards:</strong> Additional skills to surprise your enemies with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Documents:</strong> Passive stat improvements that will help you survive in the Void.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/a1adc8e432ea0aa9eb1802510ff0e13b.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=325 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/c922ee6c58ee2a789647e6597400f027.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong>he first ever roguelite where the environment is your toolkit. Set up amazing combos placing your enemies in the right spot while using the power of telekinesis at your will! Every action you do has a consequence on how the world is shaped and what can be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/704bc14f522745ae10902177b691dc15.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/704bc14f522745ae10902177b691dc15.webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/704bc14f522745ae10902177b691dc15.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/3aeb3539006515e3713a6c5fbedc7e67.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/8b16bc7d9694316eb69fbb32e6cd8d0a.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/8b16bc7d9694316eb69fbb32e6cd8d0a.webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/8b16bc7d9694316eb69fbb32e6cd8d0a.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/f90ab24b241b493cf2c0ac870fa1bc4d.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/f90ab24b241b493cf2c0ac870fa1bc4d.webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/f90ab24b241b493cf2c0ac870fa1bc4d.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the mask holders as you deepen into the Void on your way to the Neverending Night. Your skill is the key to success. Learn their patterns, discover their strategies, exploit their weaknesses. The deeper into the void you get, the harder it will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/51c3b795274aae60cc783a1a1f6233fe.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/2d101bee458e30cde8ad1994de182de4.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve all your documents and masks at the Boreal Island as you progress through runs within the Void. Evolve the Void Gifts as you use them! Grow stronger with every expedition into the Vortex. From minor to major upgrades, conquer the Void at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/ab3dde4d7f347ac6e51b4911f4b5e79b.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/ab3dde4d7f347ac6e51b4911f4b5e79b.webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/ab3dde4d7f347ac6e51b4911f4b5e79b.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/df557176105939ac7af5e375c9ae566c.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not only about throwing stuff around, but also about the meaning of power and the narrative detail within every part and piece of the game. Get to know each of the characters and their desires, uncover the secrets of the Void through the books, and discover what Power means to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/2c63256ef4ce9577c073d050a5e7ffa9.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_