onsequence on how the world is shaped and what can be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/704bc14f522745ae10902177b691dc15.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/704bc14f522745ae10902177b691dc15.webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/704bc14f522745ae10902177b691dc15.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/3aeb3539006515e3713a6c5fbedc7e67.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/8b16bc7d9694316eb69fbb32e6cd8d0a.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/8b16bc7d9694316eb69fbb32e6cd8d0a.webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/8b16bc7d9694316eb69fbb32e6cd8d0a.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/f90ab24b241b493cf2c0ac870fa1bc4d.poster.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=