webm?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/ab3dde4d7f347ac6e51b4911f4b5e79b.mp4?t=1786581115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/extras/df557176105939ac7af5e375c9ae566c.avif?t=1786581115\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not only about throwing stuff around, but also about the meaning of power and the narrative detail within every part and piece of the game. Get to know each of the characters and their desires, uncover the secrets of the Void through the books, and discover what Power means to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You don't carry a weapon. You are the weapon. Rip stone from the earth and hurl it at your enemies. Masks warp your powers into something new every single run. The Void is coming for your home. Make it regret it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Catalan, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“This is the new Spanish rogue-lite gem that hooks you from the first minute”<br>IGN Spain<br><br>“Masks of the Void: Origins stands out as one of the most addictive Spanish rogue‑lites thanks to its telekinesis, its frenetic pace and its forceful visual style”<br>Xbox Maniac<br><br>“&quot;settings that change the roguelite experience&quot;”<br>Kotaku Spain<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542350/49bd0390be0b5b7c567df7b29033289f705a09b5/header.jpg?t=1786581115", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store